              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaphuma ngigcwele, uJehova wangibuyisa ngize; ningibizelani ngokuthi nginguNawomi, lokhu uJehova efakaza ngami, nokuthi uSomandla ungicindezele na?",
